412 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 95 0 R
/T (The assessment identified a focused set of actionable AWS security weaknesses. The most urgent work is to reduce publicly reachable SSH exposure, ensure MFA coverage for console access, and align a.admin privileges to actual job responsibilities. Strengthening S3 public-access guardrails and backup versioning will improve data-protection resilience.)
/E (The assessment identified a focused set of actionable AWS security weaknesses. The most urgent work is to reduce publicly reachable SSH exposure, ensure MFA coverage for console access, and align a.admin privileges to actual job responsibilities. Strengthening S3 public-access guardrails and backup versioning will improve data-protection resilience.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 95 0 R
/T (NovaPay also has a useful foundation: encryption at rest, bucket ownership enforcement, group-level read-only access, MFA for a privileged account, CloudTrail logging, and demonstrated authorization enforcement. Addressing the prioritized findings will help convert these safeguards into a more consistent and defensible cloud security posture)
/E (NovaPay also has a useful foundation: encryption at rest, bucket ownership enforcement, group-level read-only access, MFA for a privileged account, CloudTrail logging, and demonstrated authorization enforcement. Addressing the prioritized findings will help convert these safeguards into a more consistent and defensible cloud security posture)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
