/Title (Block Public Access was OFF for both identified buckets. This is a configuration weakness because it removes a preventive guardrail. However, actual public readability was not established: neither bucket had a bucket policy, Bucket Owner Enforced was enabled, and both buckets were empty at assessment. SSE-S3 encryption was enabled, so no encryption-at-rest finding is raised.)
